From 604edf56f385b27f1480ad358b01a2e77a6bd200 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mini <mini@local>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:37:38 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] Add Explorer Timeline with local history, git commits,
 and Open Timeline actions

Adds the Explorer's Timeline section showing local-history snapshots and
git commits of the active file, with debounced O(N) rebuilds, cached
commit data, rename-following historical diffs, and clean Open Timeline
entries in the command palette, Explorer context menu, and tab menu.
